 Key Features
1. Employee Management
Registration: Add new employees with complete details including name, email, department, designation, and salary

Employee List: View, search, and manage all employee records

Edit/Delete: Update employee information or remove records as needed

Status Tracking: Monitor employee status (Active, Inactive, On Leave)

2. Department & Designation Management
Organize employees by departments (Engineering, Marketing, HR, Finance, etc.)

Assign and manage job roles/designations

Hierarchical organizational structure

3. Attendance Management
Mark daily attendance for all employees

Track present/absent status

View monthly attendance summary

Quick actions to mark all present or mark leave

4. Leave Management
Apply for leave

Approve/Reject leave requests

View leave history and status

5. Salary & Payroll Processing
Salary Components: Basic Pay, HRA, DA, Bonus, Deductions

Automatic Calculation: System automatically calculates net salary

Payroll Processing: Generate monthly payroll records with one click

Payroll Summary: View gross payroll and net pay totals

6. Payslip Generation
Display individual employee payslips

Download/Print payslips

Detailed breakdown of salary components

7. Dashboard & Reports
Statistics Dashboard: Total employees, total salary, present today, on leave

Recent Employees: Quick view of recent employee additions

Attendance Reports: Track attendance patterns

Payroll Reports: Generate salary reports

